infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Serial fan-out vs parallel dispatch
  desc Same 8 downstream calls — wall-clock collapses from sum to max
  compares
    - label Serial dispatch
      children
        - label Serial — await in a loop
          desc Pays sum(latencies), one call after another
        - label 8 calls x 30 ms = 240 ms
          desc Wall-clock grows with every added service
        - label LinkedIn feed p99 = 480 ms
          desc 8 services, ~60 ms each, fired serially
    - label Parallel dispatch
      children
        - label Parallel — Promise.all / errgroup
          desc Pays max(latencies), all calls in flight at once
        - label Slowest call = ~35 ms
          desc 240 ms to 35 ms — 7x faster, one structural change
        - label LinkedIn feed p99 = ~80 ms
          desc Slowest call + small coordination overhead
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
